          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بجھنا — bujhnā — \"to go out (of a fire); to go dark\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "صبح تک آگ بجھ گئی۔ subah tak āg bujh gaī. By morning the fire had gone out."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): وہ چراغ بجھ گیا, voh chirāgh bujh gayā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin bujhnā, \"to be extinguished\", under vijjhāyati, a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 11703). It is the partner of بجھانا: you بجھانا a fire, and it بجھنا."
            }
          ]
        },
